{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This DLC adds The Cave Explorer to the collection.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into The Cave Explorer, a unique 2D platformer perfect for casual gamers! This game offers a fresh twist with its auto-movement mechanic, where you focus on timing jumps to navigate cleverly designed levels. Your goal? Collect all coins in each stage to unlock the exit orb and venture deeper into mysterious caves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With short, bite-sized levels, The Cave Explorer is great for quick gaming sessions. Its retro-inspired simplicity and easy controls make it accessible for all skill levels, while charming sound effects and balanced audio create an engaging vibe. Ideal for a fun, low-pressure adventure, this compact 10-minute quest is perfect for a quick gaming fix.Try The Cave </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explorer today and test your timing in this fun, coin-collecting adventure!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3982230?t=1756825236","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3982230?t=1756825236","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982230/c98f6b9c889bf5ddfb143bcc7b2bc7d9aecfd402/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756825236","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982230/c98f6b9c889bf5ddfb143bcc7b2bc7d9aecfd402/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756825236","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This DLC adds The Cave Explorer to the collection.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into The Cave Explorer, a unique 2D platformer perfect for casual gamers! This game offers a fresh twist with its auto-movement mechanic, where you focus on timing jumps to navigate cleverly designed levels. Your goal? Collect all coins in each stage to unlock the exit orb and venture deeper into mysterious caves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With short, bite-sized levels, The Cave Explorer is great for quick gaming sessions. Its retro-inspired simplicity and easy controls make it accessible for all skill levels, while charming sound effects and balanced audio create an engaging vibe. Ideal for a fun, low-pressure adventure, this compact 10-minute quest is perfect for a quick gaming fix.Try The Cave </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explorer today and test your timing in this fun, coin-collecting adventure!</p>","developers":["NanningsGames"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3942710","name":"Infinite Game Cartridge Collection"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982230/655c64c61dbd70e6bce1bfab97940b89a19c3061/header.jpg?t=1756825236","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257189242,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257189242/movie480.mp4?t=1756825234","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257189242/movie_max.mp4?t=1756825234"},"name":"Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257189242/20ac4bcfb449d2432a0a796993893202b80c3580/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1756825234","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257189242/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1756825234","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257189242/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1756825234"}}],"name":"Infinite Game Cartridge Collection - The Cave Explorer","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":[